以下是一个使用 Kotlin（JVM 17）编写的函数，它接受一个 `Iterable<Map<String, Any?>>`，并根据指定的字段进行排序。如果字段缺失，则视为 `0` 进行排序。函数返回一个新的 `List<Map<String, Any?>>`。

这个函数包含一个 `main` 函数用于演示用法，所有代码都放在一个 `.kt` 文件中，仅使用标准库。

---

```kotlin
fun sortMapsByFields(
    data: Iterable<Map<String, Any?>>,
    vararg fields: String
): List<Map<String, Any?>> {
    require(fields.isNotEmpty()) { "at least one field is required" }
    val comparator = Comparator<Map<String, Any?>> { left, right ->
        var result = 0
        for (field in fields) {
            val leftValue = left[field]
            val rightValue = right[field]
            result = when {
                leftValue is Number && rightValue is Number ->
                    leftValue.toDouble().compareTo(rightValue.toDouble())
                else -> leftValue.toString().compareTo(rightValue.toString())
            }
            if (result != 0) break
        }
        result
    }
    return data.sortedWith(comparator)
}

fun main() {
    val data = listOf(
        mapOf<String, Any?>("name" to "Alice", "age" to 30),
        mapOf<String, Any?>("name" to "Bob"),
        mapOf<String, Any?>("name" to "Charlie", "age" to 25)
    )
    println(sortMapsByFields(data, "age", "name"))
}
```

